{"questions":[{"question_id":"1lfrz3d5e","paperTitle":"IIT-JEE 2009 Paper 2 Offline","year":2009,"examDate":2009,"subject":"chemistry","chapter":"solid-state","chapterGroup":"physical-chemistry","topic":"structure-of-ionic-compounds","type":"integer","marks":3,"negMarks":1,"permalink":"pthe-coordination-number-of-al-in-the-crystalline-state-of-jee-advanced-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-hqxzamg2eebzogdx","content":"<p>The coordination number of Al in the crystalline state of AlCl<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.988ex\" height=\"1.099ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -320.2 436.6 485.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(33,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is ___________.</p>","options":[],"correct_options":[],"explanation":"<p>AlCl<sub>3</sub> exists as a close packed lattice of chloride\nions Cl<sup>–</sup>\n with Al<sup>3+</sup> occupying octahedral holes.\nHence, coordination number of Al<sup>3+</sup> is = 6.</p>"}]}